  id: hoa
  title: 3. Notice of Excessive Clearance
  region: Beige Vista Estates
  briefing: Sonoran Courtesy Compliance has impounded residents' recovery equipment.
    Demolish the enforcement infrastructure, then extract the records.
  opening: 'Ellis: They fined a wheelchair ramp for exceeding the approved approach
    angle. The appeal office is an armored kiosk.'
  midpoint: 'Johnny: Their own command truck violates six driveway rules. They granted
    themselves a hardship variance.'
  closing: 'Ellis: The residents now own the road. The HOA would like to know who
    approved the craters.'
  optionalObjective: Build a 6-hit destruction combo
